er this first one, and compare to establish any overlap, or nuances.\\n\\n\\n**Analyz\\n<truncated 2814 bytes>\\nker that sends a rich image message, while the second will allow live condition checks with photo cards.\\n\\n\\n**Implementing Payment Integration**\\n\\nI\'m now integrating face-to-face payment features. I\'m focusing on the \\\"Campus Face-to-Face Escrow\\\" sheet, incorporating item price, safety checks, and a payment confirmation button. Upon confirmation, I\'ll generate a \\\"Payment Completed Receipt Card\\\" within the chat stream. I am also working on `src/data/marketplaceData.ts` to add support for rich message types.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"replace_file_content\",\"args\":{\"AllowMultiple\":\"false\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Extend ChatMessage interface in src/data/marketplaceData.ts to support image, voice, and payment cards in chat\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"73\",\"Instruction\":\"\\\"Update ChatMessage interface in src/data/marketplaceData.ts\\\"\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"\\\"export interface ChatMessage {\\\\n  id: string;\\\\n  sender: \'them\' | \'me\' | \'meetup\' | \'payment\';\\\\n  text?: string;\\\\n  time: string;\\\\n  status?: string;\\\\n  imageUrl?: string;\\\\n  imageTag?: string;\\\\n  voiceSeconds?: number;\\\\n  meetupInfo?: {\\\\n    time: string\\n<truncated 190 bytes>\",\"StartLine\":\"58\",\"TargetContent\":\"\\\"export interface ChatMessage {\\\\n  id: string;\\\\n  sender: \'them\' | \'me\' | \'meetup\';\\\\n  text?: string;\\\\n  time: string;\\\\n  status?: string;\\\\n  meetupInfo?: {\\\\n    time: string;\\\\n    location: string;\\\\n    amount: number;\\\\n    state: string;\\\\n  };\\\\n}\\\"\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/data/marketplaceData.ts\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Updating ChatMessage interface for rich chat actions\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Update ChatMessage interface\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"thinking\",\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":86,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-17T09:08:21Z\",\"input_tokens\":3261,\"cache_read_tokens\":226212,\"output_tokens\":1712,\"thinking\":\"**Refining Rich Message Handling**\\n\\nI\'m currently updating `src/App.tsx`. The goal is to allow `handleSendMessage` and `handleScheduleMeetup` to append rich messages, potentially using a custom `ChatMessage` payload. I\'m aiming for a more realistic, contextual response from the seller. This will enhance the user\'s experience significantly, making the interactions feel more dynamic and natural.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"replace_file_content\",\"args\":{\"AllowMultiple\":\"false\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Update handleSendMessage and handleScheduleMeetup in App.tsx to support rich chat messages (images, voice, payment, meetup amount) and contextual seller auto-replies\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"315\",\"Instruction\":\"\\\"Enhance chat message and meetup handlers in src/App.tsx\\\"\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"\\\"  const getContextualReply = (text: string, sellerName: string): string => {\\\\n    if (text.includes(\'\345\223\252\351\207\214\350\247\201\351\235\242\') || text.includes(\'\345\234\260\347\202\271\')) {\\\\n      return \'\346\270\205\350\277\234\346\240\241\345\214\272\346\241\202\345\233\255\345\256\277\350\210\215\344\270\200\346\245\274\345\200\274\347\217\255\345\256\244\346\227\201\346\210\226\350\200\205\345\233\276\346\226\207\344\277\241\346\201\257\344\270\255\345\277\203\345\244\247\345\240\202\351\203\275\345\217\257\344\273\245\357\274\214\347\234\213\344\275\240\347\246\273\\n<truncated 4005 bytes>\",\"StartLine\":\"243\",\"TargetContent\":\"\\\"  const handleSendMessage = (conversationId: string, text: string) => {\\\\n    setConversations((prev) =>\\\\n      prev.map((c) => {\\\\n        if (c.id !== conversationId) return c;\\\\n        return {\\\\n          ...c,\\\\n          lastMessage: text,\\\\n          ti\\n<truncated 1201 bytes>\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/App.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Updating chat handlers in App.tsx for rich functional effects\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Update chat handlers in App.tsx\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":88,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-17T09:08:49Z\",\"input_tokens\":3294,\"cache_read_tokens\":229474,\"output_tokens\":12554,\"thinking\":\"**Refining Element Focus**\\n\\nI\'m currently focused on `src/components/ChatDetailView.tsx`. My goal is to upgrade the functionality of three key elements: quick replies, the input bar, and the utilities drawer, without altering their current DOM structure. I aim to maintain the specific ordering of those elements.\\n\\n\\n**Enhancing Interaction Features**\\n\\nI\'m now integrating sophisticated interactions for both quick replies and the bottom input bar. I\'ve designed quick replies to send messages, visually confirm t\\n<truncated 186 bytes>\\nbar with recording, voice message bubbles, and animated waveforms. I\'m focusing on user-friendly emoji and phrase popover.\\n\\n\\n**Developing Utility Actions**\\n\\nI\'m now focusing on the utility drawer\'s functionality. I\'ve integrated image selection from both campus photos and local uploads, which dynamically sends image message bubbles into the chat. I\'ve also implemented a condition photo card that presents various pre-defined conditions for easy selection. Finally, I\'m working on the campus meetup feature.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"write_to_file\",\"args\":{\"CodeContent\":\"\\\"import React, { useEffect, useRef, useState } from \'react\';\\\\nimport { ConversationItem, HOTLINK_IMAGES } from \'../data/marketplaceData\';\\\\n\\\\ninterface ChatDetailViewProps {\\\\n  conversation: ConversationItem;\\\\n  onBack: () => void;\\\\n  onSendMessage: (\\\\n    \\n<truncated 47872 bytes>\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Enhance interactive functional effects of Quick Reply Pills, Bottom Input Bar, and Quick Action Utilities Drawer in ChatDetailView.tsx\\\"\",\"Overwrite\":\"true\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/components/ChatDetailView.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Updating ChatDetailView.tsx with rich interactive features\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Update ChatDetailView.tsx\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"thinking\",\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":90,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-17T09:12:23Z\",\"input_tokens\":12674,\"cache_read_tokens\":232769,\"output_tokens\":165,\"thinking\":\"**Verifying Code Updates**\\n\\nI\'ve just initiated the unit tests, compiled the applet, and restarted the dev server. My main concern is verifying the recent `ChatDetailView.tsx` changes are correctly reflected and functional in the browser environment.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"run_command\",\"args\":{\"CommandLine\":\"\\\"node --test src/data/marketplaceData.test.ts\\\"\",\"Cwd\":\"\\\".\\\"\",\"WaitMsBeforeAsync\":\"5000\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Running unit tests after ChatDetailView enhancements\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Run unit tests\\\"\"}},{\"name\":\"compile_applet\",\"args\":{\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Compiling applet after ChatDetailView enhancements\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Compile applet\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":93,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-17T09:12:36Z\",\"input_tokens\":2715,\"cache_read_tokens\":243394,\"output_tokens\":51,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"restart_dev_server\",\"args\":{\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Restarting dev server to test updated chat interactions\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Restart dev server\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":95,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-17T09:13:10Z\",\"input_tokens\":2183,\"cache_read_tokens\":244060,\"output_tokens\":265,\"thinking\":\"**Verifying Interaction**\\n\\nOkay, I\'m now focused on verifying three enhanced areas in the `Cha